摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"READ + WRITE for office documents & notebooks in DeepSeek Harness — doc_read/doc_write tools (xlsx, pdf, docx, pptx, ipynb) plus MCP server and CLI","id":"gh:1333301957","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-cowork","slug":"Jesse-njx/dsh-cowork","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","mcp","office-documents"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"READ + WRITE for office documents & notebooks in DeepSeek Harness — doc_read/doc_write tools (xlsx, "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"pdf, docx, pptx, ipynb) plus MCP server and CLI"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Cowork"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**READ + WRITE for office documents and Jupyter notebooks inside\nDeepSeek Harness — and\nanywhere els"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"e your agent runs.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DSH Cowork adds first-class document handling to coding agents:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Format | Read | Write (v1) |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| **xlsx** spreadsheets | ✅ bounded, cell-addressed windows | ✅ create + edit by cell ref |\n| **ipyn"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"b** notebooks | ✅ cells + inline outputs | ✅ create + edit by cell index |\n| **pdf** | ✅ text window"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"s (`pages`) | — (v2: form-fill) |\n| **docx** | ✅ paragraphs + word count | — (v2: generation) |\n| **"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"pptx** | ✅ slides + shape ids | — (v2: generation) |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**中文版见 README.zh.md.**"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness's built-in `read` is UTF-8 text only — it cannot open a\nspreadsheet, a PDF, a slide"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" deck, or a notebook. Claude Code reads PDFs and\nnotebooks natively; Codex has nothing. DSH Cowork c"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"loses that gap as an\nout-of-tree plugin (no fork, no PR needed — the ecosystem path\nCONTRIBUTING.md "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ap as an\nout-of-tree plugin (no fork, no PR needed — the ecosystem path\nCONTRIBUTING.md recommends)."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Two ideas make \"Cowork = READ + WRITE\" coherent instead of two separate\ntools:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"1. **Stable addresses.** `doc_read` returns *cell refs* for xlsx (`A1`, `C12`)\nand *shape ids* for p"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ptx — `doc_write` consumes them. Line numbers cannot\naddress binary formats; addresses can.\n2. **Bou"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"nded windows, explicit truncation.** Every read is capped\n(pages / rows / slides / cells / bytes). S"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ilent truncation is the cardinal\nsin: a `> Truncated:` notice always tells you the window was cut sh"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"t truncation is the cardinal\nsin: a `> Truncated:` notice always tells you the window was cut short."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Packages"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Package | What it is |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| `packages/core` | Pure TS, zero DSH deps: sniff → extract → build, windowing, safety caps |\n| `pac"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"kages/dsh` | **DSH bundle**: `doc_read` / `doc_write` tools (install with `dsh plugin add`) |\n| `pac"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"kages/mcp` | **MCP server** over stdio — for Codex, Claude Code, any MCP client |\n| `packages/cli` |"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" `doc-read` / `doc-write` binaries + `SKILL.md` (the `pi` harness adapter) |\n| `packages/chatnode-we"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"chat` | **DSH bundle**: chat with / monitor / approve your DSH agents from WeChat (iLink gateway + c"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"e**: chat with / monitor / approve your DSH agents from WeChat (iLink gateway + conversation node) |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install into DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Then `doc_read` / `doc_write` are available to the model. (A live agent\nsession also verifies: ask t"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"he model to `doc_read` an `.xlsx`.)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Configure (all optional, sensible defaults):"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Use from any agent (MCP)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Safety model"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Zip bombs**: entry-count + decompressed-size caps on every OOXML archive,\nchecked before any cod"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ec expands bytes.\n- **Macros**: `.xlsm` / `.docm` / `.pptm` (anything with `vbaProject.bin`) are\nrej"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ected outright — Cowork never reads or writes macro formats.\n- **Read-only mode**: in `read-only` sa"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ndbox mode, `doc_write` is hard-blocked\nwhile `doc_read` stays available.\n- **Edit guards**: `doc_wr"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ite` edit refuses unless the file was read this\nsession (`expected_version`), and optionally fails o"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"n content change\n(`expected_sha256`) — a hash-check on every edit.\n- **No silent overwrite**: creati"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"ng over an existing file requires having read\nit (DSH) or `force` (CLI/MCP).\n- **Atomic writes**: te"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"mp file + rename, never a partial target.\n- **Stale formulas**: edited xlsx sheets get cached formul"},{"id":"p24s9","text":"a results cleared so\nExcel / LibreOffice recalculate on open (exceljs never recalculates).\n- **Untru"},{"id":"p24s10","text":"sted input**: formulas, hidden sheets, and speaker notes are treated\nas data, surfaced with the extr"},{"id":"p24s11","text":"action, never executed."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The DSH bundle routes reads through `ctx.fs` (bounded `readBytes`,\nsandbox-aware resolution, `fs/obs"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"erved` events) and performs atomic byte\nwrites itself because the fs service is text-only — re-obser"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ving the real\npost-write version so the built-in policy machinery stays coherent."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- Fixtures: `node packages/core/scripts/make-fixtures.mjs` (needs macOS\n`cupsfilter` for the PDF; sk"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ip otherwise).\n- Node 20+; tests run on Node's native TS type-stripping."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Roadmap"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- **v1 (this repo)**: read all five formats; write xlsx + ipynb.\n- **v2**: ipynb write polish, docx/"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"pptx *generation*, PDF form-fill\n(pdf-lib), PDF page-render-to-image for vision models, docx raw-OOX"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"ML edit.\n- **Ship**: `dsh-plugin` GitHub topic, awesome-list entry, Discussions post."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"This is a `dsh-plugin`-topic project. Issues, PRs, and Discussions welcome —\nand per deepseek-harnes"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"s CONTRIBUTING.md,\nassociate your own plugins with the `dsh-plugin` topic too."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
